{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_EF37496E","title":"Part of the Club","entry":"Dlg_EF37496E::entry","exit":"Dlg_EF37496E::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_25F9A17A","articyId":"72057619807818753","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"You look like you come with jokes! What a joy!","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"You look like you come with jokes! What a joy!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":25.0,"y":350.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"50312","byteOffset":33374384,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_20FC022E","articyId":"72057619807818777","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Hmmm. How?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hmmm. How?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"41263","byteOffset":29937864,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_729C4447","articyId":"72057619807818798","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Wait! Is this still part of the joke?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Wait! Is this still part of the joke?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"18855","byteOffset":15020528,"byteLength":356}},{"id":"DFr_E6D6DF42","articyId":"72057619807818820","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"I hope you're better at fishing than you are at this.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I hope you're better at fishing than you are at this.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"16536","byteOffset":14151856,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_F7D4B14D","articyId":"72057619807818827","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Hahahaha. That's pretty good! I like it almost as much as I like fishing. Speaking of, how'd yah fare?","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Hahahaha. That's pretty good! I like it almost as much as I like fishing. Speaking of, how'd yah fare?","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36480","byteOffset":28147032,"byteLength":424}},{"id":"DFr_3A5AC279","articyId":"72057619807818843","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"By the grace of neon waters! This... This is fantastic work. Like a real fisher. Guess I have no choice.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"By the grace of neon waters! This... This is fantastic work. Like a real fisher. Guess I have no choice.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"21004","byteOffset":15828040,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_37C0F914","articyId":"72057619807818857","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Welcome to the Underground Fish Market. We don't have regular meetings and there aren't any dues.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Welcome to the Underground Fish Market. We don't have regular meetings and there aren't any dues.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":225.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"22498","byteOffset":16397376,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_B77ADD2E","articyId":"72057619807818884","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Be ready to put them fishin' skills to work. People want all kinds of things at all kinds of times. Keep your ear to the shore and eye to the sky, and you'll pick it up. For now, back to fishing for me!","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Be ready to put them fishin' skills to work. People want all kinds of things at all kinds of times. Keep your ear to the shore and eye to the sky, and you'll pick it up. For now, back to fishing for me!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3701.0,"y":200.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39236","byteOffset":29175320,"byteLength":512}},{"id":"DFr_0D18AEEA","articyId":"72057619807818894","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Boardwalk Ady","text":"Ah. Well, I do like fish more than jokes. I'll have to think about that one. While I do, tell me how you did out there.","speakerId":"Ntt_45DA943C","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Ah. Well, I do like fish more than jokes. I'll have to think about that one. While I do, tell me how you did out there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":625.0,"y":475.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43191","byteOffset":30669192,"byteLength":428}},{"id":"DFr_BA406EEC","articyId":"72057619807818758","type":"ch